Package: DTAtools
Title: Tools for Handling Data from Data Transfer Agreements (DTAs) / Data Transfer Specifications (DTS)
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Thomas", "Schwarzl", email = "thomas.schwarzl@boehringer-ingelheim.com", 
        role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7697-7000")),
    person("Daniel", "Schreyer", 
        email = "daniel.schreyer.ext@boehringer-ingelheim.com", role = c("aut", "ctb")))
Maintainer: Thomas Schwarzl <thomas.schwarzl@boehringer-ingelheim.com>
Description: Provides a comprehensive set of tools for importing, validating,
    transforming, and exporting data governed by data transfer agreements (DTAs)
    or data transfer specifications (DTS). The package supports workflows for
    handling structured data, ensuring compliance with agreement requirements,
    and facilitating reproducible data processing. Key features include flexible
    data import/export, schema validation, metadata management, and integration
    with common R data analysis pipelines.
